<title>USA: National Data not discussing acquisition.</title>
<headline>National Data not discussing acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Data Corp said on Thursday that, contrary to rumors, it is not discussing an acquisition with Medaphis Corp.</p>
<p>National Data said it was making the statement because it has received a number of inquiries, and it is in the best interests of shareholders to set the record straight.</p>
</text>
